      <h1>Ministry <i>&amp;</i> Speaking.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Twenty years in boardrooms, fifty years in Christ, and one message: the God who keeps no record of wrongs, and what it looks like to live like you believe it.</p>
      <p class="heart">I gave my life to Jesus at ten years old, and He has never once let go of me. Everything since has been an answer to that: decades on worship teams leading people into His presence, years walking alongside men who needed a brother more than a lecture, and a growing fire to tell anyone who will listen who He is. My heart is simple. I want people to meet Jesus Christ, to be forgiven past all counting, and to grow into an abiding, intimate relationship with Him, the kind that changes how you wake up on a Tuesday. Whether it&rsquo;s a stage, a breakfast table, or one man across from me, that is the work.</p>
